<title>USA: Amgen gets additional EPO patent.</title>
<headline>Amgen gets additional EPO patent.</headline>
<dateline>THOUSAND OAKS, Calif. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amgen Inc said Wednesday that the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office has granted to it a patent having additional claims to the processes for the manufacture of erythropoietin (EPO) products.</p>
<p>The new patent includes claims to processes for the production of EPO using cells that contain amplified DNA encoding the sequence of human EPO.</p>
<p>Amgen markets EPO in the United States as Epogen for the treatment of anemia associated with chronic renal failure for people on dialysis.</p>
</text>
